{"id":"n24830-1-7","stage":2,"title":"작은아버지 · 叔父","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24830-1-7-1","ko":"언니, 작은아버지께도 안부 말씀 전해 주세요.","zh":"姐姐，也请代我向叔父问好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"언니,","meaning":"姐姐、大姐（女性对年长女性的亲切称呼）","explanation":"언니：姐姐、大姐（女性对年长女性的亲切称呼）","readings":[{"term":"언니","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31971","senseId":"3","lemma":"언니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언니","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3"}},{"text":"작은아버지께도","meaning":"叔父，叔叔","explanation":"작은아버지：叔父，叔叔；께：에게 的敬语形式，表示“给、向、对”某位受尊敬的人。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"작은아버지","audio":"/audio/52c4ffed038a13434994.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24830","senseId":"1","lemma":"작은아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"작은아버지께도","audio":"/audio/5405416470a8c09cc54f.mp3"}},{"text":"안부","meaning":"问候","explanation":"안부：问候","readings":[{"term":"안부","audio":"/audio/5fd69abae96ae59b4e30.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16006","senseId":"1","lemma":"안부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안부","audio":"/audio/5fd69abae96ae59b4e30.mp3"}},{"text":"말씀","meaning":"话","explanation":"말씀：话","readings":[{"term":"말씀","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27365","senseId":"1","lemma":"말씀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말씀","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3"}},{"text":"전해","meaning":"转达","explanation":"전하다：转达；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"전하다","audio":"/audio/4adf4bd60c3c16263914.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75767","senseId":"4","lemma":"전하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전해","audio":"/audio/664a008b2ea42ac6016c.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9ab740751e1be982","term":"언니","zh":"姐姐、大姐（女性对年长女性的亲切称呼）","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3","entryId":"31971","definition":"女子用于亲切地指称或称呼比自己年长的女性。","pronunciation":["언니"]},{"id":"52c4ffed038a1343","term":"작은아버지","zh":"叔父，叔叔","audio":"/audio/52c4ffed038a13434994.mp3","entryId":"24830","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的弟弟，主要指结了婚的弟弟。","pronunciation":["자근아버지"]},{"id":"5fd69abae96ae59b","term":"안부","zh":"问候","audio":"/audio/5fd69abae96ae59b4e30.mp3","entryId":"16006","definition":"某人是否过得平安的消息；或指转达或询问那个来打招呼。","pronunciation":["안부"]},{"id":"9fa325aa12d3fdd0","term":"말씀","zh":"话","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3","entryId":"27365","definition":"(敬语)别人的言语。","pronunciation":["말ː씀"]},{"id":"4adf4bd60c3c1626","term":"전하다","zh":"转达","audio":"/audio/4adf4bd60c3c16263914.mp3","entryId":"75767","definition":"将消息、想法等告知对方。","pronunciation":["전하다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0397f6685240c00fc304.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24830-1-7-2","ko":"그래. 언제 한번 집으로 놀러 와.","zh":"好啊。什么时候来我家玩吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래.","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"언제","meaning":"哪天，哪会儿","explanation":"언제：哪天，哪会儿","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}},{"text":